    "introductoryText": "Loads **transactions** from the **Slim CD** payment gateway (its SearchTransactions2 report) and writes one record per transaction, with the gateway ID, date, type, amount, approval, card type and customer details.\n\n**How to set it up**\n1. Enter the Slim CD username, password and Site ID (required).\n2. Set a start and end date to keep the search small (recommended).\n3. Optionally set filters (name, e-mail, amount, transaction type and so on); empty filters are not sent.\n4. Run the block.\n\nTips:\n- Tick **Record count only** first to see how many transactions a search would return.\n- If the gateway limits the result, narrow the date range or set **Max records**.\n- Dates, amounts and IDs are typed; tick **Treat all output fields as text** to keep every value exactly as Slim CD sent it.",
    "dependencies": "requests",
    "options": [
        {
            "name": "username",
            "title": "Username",
            "description": "The Slim CD username.",
            "groupTitle": "Credentials",
            "width": "ONE",
            "@visokiotype": "CustomBlockSchema.TextCustomBlockPublicOption",
            "mandatory": true,
            "defaultValue": ""
        },
        {
            "name": "password",
            "title": "Password",
            "description": "The Slim CD password (may be empty for API access credentials).",
            "groupTitle": "Credentials",
            "width": "ONE",
            "@visokiotype": "CustomBlockSchema.PasswordCustomBlockPublicOption",
            "mandatory": true
        },
        {
            "name": "siteid",
            "title": "Site ID",
            "description": "Your Slim CD Site ID (a number).",
